<title>FINLAND: INCAP SAYS PUBLIC OFFERING 74 PCT OVERSUBSCRIBED.</title>
<headline>INCAP SAYS PUBLIC OFFERING 74 PCT OVERSUBSCRIBED.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish electronic and furniture subcontractor Incap Oy said in a statement on Friday its public offering had been 74 percent oversubscribed.</p>
<p>Incap earlier said it would offer 200,000 shares to the public and 600,000 shares to institutional investors; all priced at 44 markka per share.  </p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +368-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
